    "This language leads the quotations. The buttons stay as they are.": "Haec lingua dicta praecēdit. Ea quae premuntur manent ut sunt.",
    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "Notae servātae legī nōn potuērunt. Fac locum et TLNotes iterum aperī, aut id quod servāvistī restitue. Nota nunc addita novum diārium incipit.",
