    "The phone calendar could not be read. Allow calendar access and try again.": "Calendārium tēlephōniī legī nōn potuit. Dā licentiam et iterum cōnāre.",
    "The phone calendar had nothing in the past year or the next two years.": "Calendārium tēlephōniī nihil habuit in annō praeteritō aut in duobus annīs futūrīs.",
