    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Imāginēs, etiam praevīsa vinculōrum, angustum locum huius sitūs cum notīs tuīs partiuntur. Sī is locus impletur, nova nota servārī nōn potest.",
