    "Checking the published package.": "Fasciculus ēditus inspicitur.",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Novior fasciculus Android in sitū est. Dēscende eum, deinde instituere. Prius ex Datīs effer, sī exemplum vīs.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "Hic fasciculus eī in sitū pār est.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "Fasciculus sitūs legī nōn potuit. Nihil dēscēnsum est.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Hōc incēnsō, inspectiō fasciculum Android cum sitū ēditum vidēre potest. Nihil dēscendit nisi rogās.",

    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "Vīta, in quā notae cottīdiānae dicta numerō superant. Tollī potest.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Notae sunt omnia quae servantur. Imāginēs numerant pictūrās et visūs in diāriō conditōs, nōn adlocūtiōnem quae adhūc alibi ostendit. Magnitūdō est tōtum exemplum. In imāginibus est quantum eius illa cōnstant. Capacitas est quod hic nāvigātor sitū praebet. Adhibitum est omne quod situs condidit. Reliquum est quod superest.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Nāvigātor est tabella. Situs institūtus est exemplum in tabulā domesticā. Utrumque imāginēs, etiam praevīsa vinculōrum, servāre potest aut nōn. Ūnum prōmptuārium commune habent. Sī id implētur, nota nova fortasse nōn servābitur.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Ēlige fasciculum quem hic libellus apertum tenēre possit, etiam in capsa quae iam ipsa inter sē concors est, cuiusmodi est Syncthing. Permissum manet, ita ut fasciculus ipse et legātur et scrībātur. Nota recentior servātur. Dēlētiō quoque trānsit. Dispositio in hōc instrumentō manet. Diārium obsignātum illūc nōn scrībitur. Utrimque solve obsignātiōnem, deinde rursus obsignā.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "Verba, lingua, et fons sī habēs.",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "Nūntius mūtātiōnis in TLNotes. Tibi additur. Genus nōn est quod ipse ēligās.",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Imāginēs in sitū institūtō exstinctae sunt. Accende eās in Institūtīs ut ūnam hīc servēs.",
