    "Write below. A draft keeps the time you wrote it. Make it an event to pin a date, or a period to draw a line down the days it covers.":
      "在下面写。草稿记下你写下的时刻。改成事件可以钉住一个日期，改成时期可以沿它所覆盖的日子画一条线。",
    "The notes are still here. The filters are hiding them.": "笔记还在。是筛选把它们藏起来了。",
    "The app uses this language: the settings, the buttons, and these notes. Quotations lead in it when that wording is here. This device is the default. Latin and every language the app speaks are always listed. A language brought in only by a note changes the leading quotation, not the buttons.":
      "应用使用这门语言：设置、按钮和这些笔记。引文在有该表述时用它领先。此设备为默认。拉丁语和应用会说的每一种语言始终列出。仅由一条笔记带来的语言只改变领先的引文，不改变按钮。",
    "Removed notes stay here until you restore them or empty the trash.": "移除的笔记留在这里，直到你恢复它们或清空废纸篓。",
    "No meaning model is on. Text search still works.": "没有开启语义模型。文本搜索仍然可用。",
    "Parchment is the room as it starts. The others change the colour and the edges. Art Deco is a cream page under a black bar edged in gold. Classical is stone, and Tea is paper with one red seal. Ledger is a blue book with a red Now. Admiralty is a chart. Chapel is indigo and gold. Fresco is plaster. Pocket, Dungeon, and Tavern are the old game colours. The type does not change with them. Catalog is a drawer of index cards. Blueprint is a drawing. Terminal is a phosphor screen and sets its own type. Broadsheet is a newspaper page. CDE and IRIX share one old window frame. CDE is wheat on a teal desk. IRIX is gray on an indigo desk. Turbo Vision is the old text window: a pale blue desk, a blue page in a thick white frame, a hard shadow, and its own type. Classic Mac is the platinum desk: a pale pinstripe, a menu bar, and white windows with a striped title.":
      "羊皮纸是最初的房间。其余的改变颜色和边缘。装饰艺术是奶油色的页面，上面是镶金边的黑条。古典是石头，茶是纸，只有一枚红印。账簿是蓝书，现在是一条红线。海军部是海图。礼拜堂是靛蓝与金。壁画是灰泥。掌机、地牢和酒馆是旧游戏的颜色。字体不随它们改变。目录是一屉索引卡片。蓝图是一张图。终端是磷光屏，并自定字体。报版是一页报纸。CDE 与 IRIX 共用同一种旧窗口框。CDE 是青色桌面上的麦色。IRIX 是靛蓝桌面上的灰色。Turbo Vision 是旧的文本窗口：淡蓝桌面、蓝色页面、粗白框、硬阴影，并自定字体。",
    "Five Monaspace faces, kept in the app. Nothing is fetched for the type. Size scales the whole page.":
      "五种 Monaspace 字体，留在应用里。字体不需要另行下载。字号缩放整页。",
    "Checking the published copy.": "正在查看已发布的副本。",
    "This copy matches the published one. A newer one will wait until you apply it.": "这个副本与已发布的一致。更新的版本会等到你应用它。",
    "Check compares this copy with the published one. Nothing changes until you apply an update.": "检查把这个副本与已发布的相比。在你应用更新之前，什么都不会变。",
    "In Safari, use Share, then Add to Home Screen.": "在 Safari 中，使用分享，然后添加到主屏幕。",
    "JSON is a full backup, including the trash and any picture kept with a note. A calendar file is the iCalendar standard: events, dated tasks, and periods.":
      "JSON 是完整备份，包括废纸篓和笔记中保存的图片。日历文件采用 iCalendar 标准：事件、有日期的任务，以及时期。",
    "On the phone, choose a file the system can keep open, including one inside a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. On a computer, choose that same file in a Chromium browser. TLNotes reads and writes it on its own, and keeps whichever note is newer. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there, because the file would undo the seal. Unseal on both devices to sync, then seal again after.":
      "在手机上，选择系统能够保持打开的文件，包括已经在同步的文件夹里的文件，例如 Syncthing。在电脑上，用 Chromium 浏览器选择同一个文件。TLNotes 自己读写它，并保留较新的那条笔记。删除也会过去。布局留在这台设备上。封存的笔记不会写到那里，因为那会解开封存。要同步，先在两台设备上解除封存，之后再封上。",
  
    "Link previews": "链接预览",
    "This turns link previews on and off. On keeps a small picture and the page title with the address. Off shows only the address. A picture already kept stays on the note.": "用来打开或关闭链接预览。开时保存一张小图和页面标题，并保留地址。关时只显示地址。已经保存的图片仍留在笔记上。",
    "The faces are kept in the app. Nothing is fetched when you switch. Size scales the whole page.": "字体留在应用里。切换时不会再去取。字号改变整页的大小。",
