    "Nothing in this view matches.": "这个视图里没有相符的。",
    "Nothing on the timeline to jump to yet.": "时间线上还没有可跳转的地方。",
    "The type filter is leaving them out of this list.": "类型筛选把它们留在这份列表之外。",
    "Drag a task by the bar at its edge. Drop it on another to nest it.": "按住任务边缘的条来拖动。放到另一条上，使它成为子项。",
    "Leave the end year empty and the line stays open.": "结束年留空，这条线就一直开着。",
    "The words in their original language are the title of the saying.": "原文的词句就是这条语录的标题。",
    "A sample life, so the colored lines have eras to hold. Your notes stay on this device.": "一份示例人生，好让彩线有时代可依。你的笔记留在这台设备上。",
    "A search is BM25 over the view that is open. Stem and Fuzzy sit on the search itself. A meaning model is optional, fetched once, and kept in this browser. It is not part of the backup.": "搜索是对当前视图做 BM25。词干和模糊都在搜索本身。含义模型可选，取一次，留在这个浏览器里。它不属于备份。",
    "Multilingual E5 is a smaller model made for search across languages.": "多语言 E5 是一个较小的模型，用来跨语言搜索。",
    "EmbeddingGemma is a larger multilingual model. The copy used here is reduced so it can stay on the device.": "EmbeddingGemma 是更大的多语言模型。这里用的副本经过缩小，才能留在设备上。",
    "This browser cannot install TLNotes, and updates are not available here.": "这个浏览器不能安装 TLNotes，这里也没有更新。",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "有一份更新已准备好，等你应用。若要一份副本，先从数据里导出。",
    "An update is ready. This copy stays until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "有一份更新已准备好。这一份会留着，直到你应用它。若要副本，先从数据里导出。",
    "This check could not see the published copy, so nothing was called current and nothing was applied.": "这次检查看不到已发布的那一份，所以没有称为最新，也没有应用任何东西。",
    "This is an installed PWA.": "这是已安装的 PWA。",
    "1 done": "已完成 1",
    "1 note": "1 条笔记",
    "1 open": "未完成 1",
    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "MyST 页。标题是它的名字，链接是它的关系。",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "一本书。标题是它的名字。作者和主题是其他页面的名字。",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "一本书。标题是名字。作者、体裁和版本是这条记录。",
    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "一段影像。文字可有可无。只保留开头，最多二十秒。",
    "A few words, if you want": "若要，写几句",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "大图或长片会先缩小再留下。超过二十秒的影像只留开头。获取时留下地址，网站允许时也留下文件。",
    "A long phrase is the sort of secret that holds.": "长句子才是撑得住的秘密。",
    "A name": "一个名字",
    "A name, or Q42": "名字，或 Q42",
    "A new tag": "新标签",
    "A person in the repertorium. Not a timeline note.": "名录里的一个人。不是时间线上的笔记。",
    "A person, kept in the repertorium. The title is the name.": "一个人，留在名录里。标题就是名字。",
    "A picture. Words are optional.": "一张图片。文字可有可无。",
    "A property, a value, and only the qualifier and source that change the claim.": "一条属性、一个值，以及真正改变说法的限定和出处。",
    "A sealed journal is not written to the sync file. Unseal it on both devices to sync, then seal it again.": "封存的日记不会写入同步文件。两边都先解开再同步，然后重新封存。",
    "A small picture address": "小图地址",
    "A span. It draws a line across the timeline.": "一段时期。会在时间线上画出一条线。",
    "A subject": "一个主题",
    "A tap adds or removes a tag. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one. Order is the arrangement you dragged. Edited and Added sort by those times. Done stays hidden until you show it.": "点一下加上或去掉标签。连点或长按只留那一个。顺序是你拖出来的排列。编辑和添加按那些时间排。已完成一直藏着，直到你把它显示出来。",
    "A tap adds or removes. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one.": "点一下加上或去掉。连点或长按只留那一个。",
