    "Original ({language})": "原文（{language}）",
    "The theme is the frame: windows, bars, and corners. It does not choose the colours.": "主题是边框：窗口、横条和角落。它不决定颜色。",
    "The colour scheme is the ink and the paper. It pairs with any theme.": "配色是墨和纸。它可以配任何主题。",
    "This language leads the quotations. The buttons stay as they are.": "这种语言只改引文的先导。按钮保持原样。",
    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "已保存的笔记没有打开。腾出空间后再打开 TLNotes，或恢复一份备份。现在添加笔记会开始一本新日记。",
    "Moved {n} to trash": "已将 {n} 条移到废纸篓",
