    "The phone calendar could not be read. Allow calendar access and try again.": "读不到手机日历。允许日历访问后再试。",
    "The phone calendar had nothing in the past year or the next two years.": "手机日历在过去一年和未来两年里是空的。",
    "Import the phone calendar": "导入手机日历",
    "Add {n} event from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "从这台手机添加 {n} 条事件？相同的事件会更新，不会重复。",
    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "从这台手机添加 {n} 条事件？相同的事件会更新，不会重复。",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "图片，包括链接预览，和你的笔记共用这个站点有限的空间。空间满了，新笔记可能存不下。",
    "Pictures kept in this copy will be removed.": "这份副本里保存的图片会被去掉。",
    "{n} selected": "已选 {n}",
    "Tag": "标签",
    "The tag is added to every selected note. Tags they already have stay.": "这个标签会加到每一条选中的笔记上。它们已有的标签还在。",
    "Add another source": "再加一处出处",
    "About this type": "关于这种类型",
    "Times": "时间",
    "Update": "更新",
    "Website package": "网站安装包",
    "This package only": "仅此安装包",
    "Check the website": "查看网站",
    "Download the Android update": "下载 Android 更新",
    "Browser": "浏览器",
    "Installed site": "已安装的站点",
    "Checking the published package.": "正在查看已发布的安装包。",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "网站上有更新的 Android 安装包。下载后再安装。若要留一份副本，请先从数据导出。",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "这个安装包和网站上的一致。",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "读不到网站上的安装包。没有下载任何东西。",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "打开之后，检查才能看到随网站发布的 Android 安装包。你不要求，就不会下载。",

    "A share can open in the editor, or be added the same way as a line typed in the box. A bare address becomes a link. A line in quotation marks becomes a quotation. Anything else is a draft.": "分享的内容可以在编辑器里打开，也可以像在框里写下的一行那样加进来。单独一个地址变成链接。引号里的一行变成引文。其余的是草稿。",
    "Right-handed puts the scope rail and the buttons on the right, and left-handed puts them on the left. Floating is a vertical stack over the lower tail of the timeline. Strip is a transparent row, so the page stays clear. Scope lines, period rules, and the Now line share the line weight.": "右手把导轨和按钮放在右边，左手放在左边。浮动是时间线末端上方的一竖排。横条是透明的一行，好让页面留空。范围线、时期线和现在线共用线的粗细。",
    "Notes is everything kept, including pages. Pictures counts images saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In pictures is how much of that backup those images take.": "笔记是留下的一切，包括页面。图片计的是日记里保存的图，不是仍指向别处的地址。大小是整份备份。图片所占是这些图在备份里占多少。",
    "OneLook lists the dictionaries for a word, then the Wiktionary senses. Wiktionary, on its own, uses the app language, English, and Latin. Wikipedia is the lead from that encyclopedia, with a small picture when there is one. EncycloSearch and Oldpedia keep a short entry and name the other encyclopedias that have the subject. Oldpedia can be slow. Wikidata is the entity, and an address of a wiki page keeps a link to the original. The article itself is not copied whole.": "OneLook 列出一个词的各部词典，然后是 Wiktionary 的义项。Wiktionary 单独使用时，用应用的语言、英语和拉丁语。Wikipedia 是那部百科的起头，有图时附一张小图。EncycloSearch 和 Oldpedia 留一条短目，并写出其他也有这个题目的百科。Oldpedia 可能慢。Wikidata 是那个实体，维基页面的地址留着通向原文的链接。文章本身并不整篇抄下。",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations, and a shelf of sayings in the languages they were written in. Both can be removed.": "一段生活，普通笔记多于引文，还有一架格言，用它们写成时的语言。两样都可以去掉。",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy. Applying it does not refresh the Android share sheet.": "有一份更新，等你应用。若要一份副本，先从数据导出。应用它不会刷新 Android 的分享页。",
    "This is an installed PWA. If other apps do not list TLNotes, remove the icon and install it again. Updating from here does not refresh the share sheet.": "这是已安装的 PWA。如果别的应用里没有 TLNotes，去掉图标再装一次。从这里更新不会刷新分享页。",

    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "一段生活，平常的笔记多过引文。可以去掉。",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "笔记是留下的全部。媒体计的是日记里保存的图片和短片，不是还指向别处的地址。大小是整份备份。在媒体中是这些文件占备份的多少。额度是这个浏览器给站点的地方。已用是站点已经放下的全部。剩余是还空着的。",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "浏览器是一个标签页。安装版是主屏幕上的那一份。二者都可以留图片，包括链接预览，也可以不留。它们共用一处储存。那处满了，新的笔记也许存不下。",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "选一个本应用可以一直打开的文件，包括已经在同步的文件夹里的，例如 Syncthing。许可会留下，于是文件自己被读、被写。较新的笔记留下。删除也会过去。布局留在这台设备上。封存的日记不写到那里。先在两台设备上解封，然后再封。",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "原文、语言，有出处就写上。",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "TLNotes 有一处改动的消息。替你加上的。不是你可以选的类型。",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "安装版里图片是关着的。到设置里打开，才能在这里留一张。",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "浏览器里图片是关着的。到设置里打开，才能在这里留一张。",
