    "A window was blocked. Allow it, or open TLNotes in its own tab and choose the file there.": "Okno bylo zablokováno. Povol ho, nebo otevři TLNotes ve vlastní kartě a soubor zvol tam.",
    "A word": "Slovo",
    "A word, in the language it was kept.": "Slovo v jazyce, ve kterém bylo uloženo.",
    "A work, with its author and its date.": "Dílo, s autorem a datem.",
    "A year, and a month if you want one.": "Rok a měsíc, pokud ho chceš.",
