    "Add a title": "Sīsakaṃ āropehi",
    "Add to calendar": "Dinapaṇṇikāya āropehi",
    "Move to trash": "Chaḍḍitaṃ nehi",
    "Add statement": "Kathanaṃ āropehi",
    "Choose the file both devices share.": "Yaṃ sañcikaṃ ubho yantāni bhājenti, taṃ rocehi.",
    "Opening…": "Vivarīyati…",
    "Reading…": "Paṭhīyati…",
    "Reading the open view": "Vivaṭaṃ dassanaṃ paṭhīyati",
    "Fetching the model…": "Paṭirūpo āharīyati…",
    "The model did not load.": "Paṭirūpo na āruhi.",
    "Meaning is included": "Attho antogato",
    "Sayings": "Vacanāni",
    "Nothing in this view matches.": "Imasmiṃ dassane na kiñci sandissati.",
    "Nothing on the timeline to jump to yet.": "Kāla-pantiyā plavanokāso na tāva atthi.",
    "The type filter is leaving them out of this list.": "Pakāra-sodhanaṃ tāni imāya sūciyā bahi chaḍḍeti.",
    "Drag a task by the bar at its edge. Drop it on another to nest it.": "Kiccaṃ anta-daṇḍena ākaḍḍha. Aññasmiṃ pātāhi, yathā taṃ tassa anto tiṭṭheyya.",
    "Leave the end year empty and the line stays open.": "Anta-saṃvaccharaṃ suññaṃ ṭhapehi, rekhā ca vivaṭā tiṭṭhati.",
    "The words in their original language are the title of the saying.": "Mūla-bhāsāya padāni vacanassa sīsakaṃ honti.",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Navakaraṇaṃ sajjitaṃ, yāva tvaṃ taṃ payojesi tāva āgameti. Yadi tvaṃ paṭilipiṃ icchasi, paṭhamaṃ Sannicayato nīharāhi.",
    "This is an installed PWA.": "Idaṃ patiṭṭhāpitaṃ PWA hoti.",
    "1 done": "1 niṭṭhita",
    "1 note": "1 lekhā",
    "1 open": "1 vivaṭa",
    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "MyST paṇṇaṃ. Sīsakāni tassa nāmāni, bandhanāni ca sambandhā.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "Potthako. Sīsakaṃ tassa nāmaṃ. Kattāro ca visayā ca aññesaṃ paṇṇānaṃ nāmāni.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "Potthako. Sīsakaṃ tassa nāmaṃ. Kattāro, vidhā, āvutti ca ālekho honti.",
    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "Calanakhaṇḍo. Padāni yadicchakāni. Rakkhito āyāmo ādi hoti, yāva vīsati khaṇā.",
    "A few words, if you want": "Katipayāni padāni, yadi tvaṃ icchasi",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "Mahantaṃ rūpaṃ calanakhaṇḍo vā rakkhaṇato pubbe saṃkhīyati. Yo calanakhaṇḍo vīsati khaṇehi dīghataro, so kevalaṃ ādiṃ rakkhati. Āharaṇaṃ saṃketaṃ rakkhati, sañcikañca yadā ṭhānaṃ anujānāti.",
    "A long phrase is the sort of secret that holds.": "Dīghaṃ vākyaṃ tādisaṃ guyhaṃ hoti yaṃ tiṭṭhati.",
    "A name": "Nāmaṃ",
    "A name, or Q42": "Nāmaṃ, Q42 vā",
    "A new tag": "Navā saññā",
    "A person in the repertorium. Not a timeline note.": "Nāmāvaliyaṃ puggalo. Na kāla-panti-lekhā.",
    "A person, kept in the repertorium. The title is the name.": "Puggalo, nāmāvaliyaṃ rakkhito. Sīsakaṃ nāmaṃ hoti.",
    "A picture. Words are optional.": "Rūpaṃ. Padāni yadicchakāni.",
    "A property, a value, and only the qualifier and source that change the claim.": "Guṇo, mūlyaṃ, tañca visesakañca nidānañca yeva yaṃ abhikathanaṃ parivatteti.",
    "A sealed journal is not written to the sync file. Unseal it on both devices to sync, then seal it again.": "Mudditā dinacariyā saṃsandana-sañcikāya na likhīyati. Saṃsandanatthāya ubhosu yantesu muddaṃ apanehi, tato puna muddehi.",
    "A small picture address": "Khuddaka-rūpa-saṃketo",
    "A span. It draws a line across the timeline.": "Addhā. Ayaṃ kāla-pantiyā rekhāṃ ākaḍḍhati.",
    "A subject": "Visayo",
    "A tap adds or removes a tag. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one. Order is the arrangement you dragged. Edited and Added sort by those times. Done stays hidden until you show it.": "Phasso saññaṃ āropeti vā apaneti. Dvikkhattuṃ phasso dīgha-pīḷanaṃ vā taṃ yeva rakkhati. Paṭipāṭi so vinyāso hoti yaṃ tvaṃ ākaḍḍhi. Sampāditañca Āropitañca tehi kālehi kamīyanti. Niṭṭhitaṃ paṭicchannaṃ tiṭṭhati yāva tvaṃ taṃ dassesi.",
    "A tap adds or removes. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one.": "Phasso āropeti vā apaneti. Dvikkhattuṃ phasso dīgha-pīḷanaṃ vā taṃ yeva rakkhati.",
    "A title and an address.": "Sīsakañca saṃketo ca.",
    "A translator": "Anuvādako",
    "A wiki address": "Viki-saṃketo",
    "A window was blocked. Allow it, or open TLNotes in its own tab and choose the file there.": "Vātapānaṃ vāritaṃ. Taṃ anujānāhi, TLNotes vā sakasmiṃ pattadale vivaritvā tattha sañcikaṃ rocehi.",
    "A word": "Padaṃ",
    "A word, in the language it was kept.": "Padaṃ, yāya bhāsāya taṃ rakkhitaṃ.",
    "A work, with its author and its date.": "Gantho, kattārā ca kālena ca.",
    "A year, and a month if you want one.": "Saṃvaccharaṃ, māso ca yadi tvaṃ icchasi.",
    "About arranging tasks": "Kiccānaṃ vinyāse",
    "Add a source": "Nidānaṃ āropehi",
    "Add another appearance": "Aññaṃ pātubhāvaṃ āropehi",
    "Add one, or choose from the tags already in the journal.": "Ekaṃ āropehi, dinacariyāya ṭhitāsu saññāsu vā rocehi.",
    "Add tags": "Saññāyo āropehi",
    "Add {n} item from the calendar? Matching notes are updated, not duplicated.": "Dinapaṇṇikāto {n} vatthuṃ tvaṃ āropesi? Saṃgatā lekhāyo navakarīyanti, na duvidhā karīyanti.",
    "Add {n} items from the calendar? Matching notes are updated, not duplicated.": "Dinapaṇṇikāto {n} vatthūni tvaṃ āropesi? Saṃgatā lekhāyo navakarīyanti, na duvidhā karīyanti.",
    "Added": "Āropita",
    "Added. Clear search to see it.": "Āropitaṃ. Dassanatthāya gavesanaṃ apanehi.",
    "Address it was fetched from": "Yato saṃketato taṃ āhaṭaṃ",
    "Addresses, with the preview that came back with them.": "Saṃketā, tehi saddhiṃ āgata-pubbadassanena.",
    "All notes cleared": "Sabbā lekhāyo lopitā",
    "An author": "Kattā",
    "Another title": "Aññaṃ sīsakaṃ",
    "Attach": "Ābandha",
    "Attach a picture or clip": "Rūpaṃ calanakhaṇḍaṃ vā ābandha",
    "Author": "Kattā",
    "Authors": "Kattāro",
    "Available tags": "Upalabbhamānā saññāyo",
    "Back": "Paccāgaccha",
    "Begins": "Ārabhati",
    "Calendar exported": "Dinapaṇṇikā nīhaṭā",
    "Calendar imported": "Dinapaṇṇikā ānītā",
    "Caption": "Rūpalekhā",
    "Change": "Parivattehi",
    "Choose a picture or a video.": "Rūpaṃ calanarūpaṃ vā rocehi.",
    "Choose the file in the window that just opened. This page can use it once that is done.": "Idāni vivaṭe vātapāne sañcikaṃ rocehi. Tasmiṃ kate ayaṃ paṇṇo taṃ upayojetuṃ sakkoti.",
    "Chromium hides the file picker in a page that is inside another window, or that is not https. Open TLNotes in its own tab and choose the file there.": "Chromium sañcikā-rocakaṃ paṭicchādeti yo paṇṇo aññassa vātapānassa anto, yo vā na https. TLNotes sakasmiṃ pattadale vivarāhi, tattha ca sañcikaṃ rocehi.",
    "Clear all data": "Sabbaṃ sannicayaṃ lopāhi",
    "Clear search": "Gavesanaṃ apanehi",
    "Clip": "Calanakhaṇḍa",
    "Clip length": "Calanakhaṇḍa-āyāma",
    "Close": "Pidahāhi",
    "Color {color}": "Vaṇṇa {color}",
    "Copied": "Paṭilikhita",
    "Could not attach that.": "Taṃ ābandhituṃ na sakkā.",
    "Could not copy": "Paṭilikhituṃ na sakkā",
    "Could not copy that file.": "Taṃ sañcikaṃ paṭilikhituṃ na sakkā.",
