    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Navataro Android koso jālaṭṭhāne atthi. Taṃ otārehi, tato patiṭṭhāpehi. Yadi tvaṃ paṭilipiṃ icchasi, paṭhamaṃ Sannicayato nīharāhi.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "Ayaṃ koso jālaṭṭhānassa kosena sandissati.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "Jālaṭṭhāna-koso paṭhituṃ na sakkā. Na kiñci otāritaṃ.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Yadā idaṃ pavattaṃ, parikkhā taṃ Android kosaṃ passituṃ sakkoti yo jālaṭṭhānena saddhiṃ pakāsito. Na kiñci otarati yāva tvaṃ yācasi.",
  
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "Jīvitaṃ, yattha pakati-lekhā uddesehi bahutarā. Apanetuṃ sakkā.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Lekhāyo sabbaṃ yaṃ rakkhitaṃ. Rūpasadda tāni rūpāni ca calanakhaṇḍāni ca gaṇeti yāni dinacariyāya rakkhitāni, na taṃ ṭhānaṃ yaṃ ajjāpi aññattha dasseti. Pamāṇaṃ sabbā paṭirūpā. Rūpasadde tassā paṭirūpāya kittakaṃ tāni potthakāni gaṇhanti. Khamatā yaṃ ayaṃ jāladassako ṭhānassa dassati. Upayuttaṃ sabbaṃ yaṃ ṭhānaṃ ṭhapesi. Avasiṭṭhaṃ yaṃ avasissati.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Jāladassako paṭṭikā hoti. Ṭhapita-ṭhānaṃ ghara-paṭassa paṭirūpaṃ hoti. Ekaṃ ekaṃ rūpāni rakkhituṃ sakkoti, sandhi-pubbadassanāni ca, na vā. Ekaṃ koṭṭhāgāraṃ bhājenti. Sace taṃ pūrati, navaṃ lekhaṃ na rakkheyya.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Taṃ potthakaṃ rocehi yaṃ idaṃ yantaṃ vivaṭaṃ dhāretuṃ sakkoti, tampi yaṃ saṃsandamānāya peṭikāya atthi, yathā Syncthing. Anuññā tiṭṭhati, tena potthakaṃ sayaṃ paṭhīyati ca likhīyati ca. Navataraṃ lekhaṃ tiṭṭhati. Apanayanaṃ pi gacchati. Vinyāso imasmiṃ yante tiṭṭhati. Muditaṃ dinacariyaṃ tattha na likhīyati. Ubhayattha muddaṃ mocehi, tato puna muddehi.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "Padāni, bhāsā, nidānañ ca sace atthi.",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "TLNotes-assa pariṇāmavārttā. Tuyhaṃ āropitā. Na so pakāro yaṃ tvaṃ rocaye.",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Ṭhapita-ṭhāne rūpāni nivuttāni. Idha ekaṃ rakkhituṃ Ṭhapanāya tāni pavattehi.",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Jāladassake rūpāni nivuttāni. Idha ekaṃ rakkhituṃ Ṭhapanāya tāni pavattehi.",
