    "A birthday lays one period for each year of life, from birth through the year now under way. That year stays open. Running it again replaces those periods.": "yawmā d-mawlādā sām ʿeddānā l-kul šattā d-ḥayyē, men mawlādā w-ʿaḏammā l-šattā d-hāšā rādyā. hāy šattā ptīḥā. kad tūb, hānon ʿeddānē metḥallepīn.",
