    "The faces are kept in the app. Nothing is fetched when you switch. Size scales the whole page.": "parṣopē nṭīrīn ba-mašmeštā. meddem lā metʾītē kad mḥallep ʾatt. mšuḥtā mšawḥyā kullāh ṣaḥḥā.",
