    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "egartē nṭīrātā lā ʾetṭʿen. šrē dukktā wa-ptaḥ TLNotes tub, aw ʾapnī nuskā da-nṭārā. mawsep egartā hāšā šārē yāwmānā ḥadtā.",
