    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "ḥayyē, da-b-hōn egartē šḥīmātā saggiyān men peṯgāmē. meškah da-nettnse.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "egartē kul meddem da-metnaṭṭar. ʾāwārē mānyān ṣalmē wa-qeṭʿē da-b-yāwmānā, lā ʾaškā da-ʿadakkīl l-ʾaḥrēn maḥwyā. mšuḥtā kul paṭrūpā. ba-ʾāwārē kmā men hāy paṭrūpā hānnōn qenyānē nāsbīn. pussāqā meddem da-hānnā mʿayyānā l-dukktā yāheb. metḥaššaḥ kul meddem da-dukktā sāmat. šarkā meddem da-pāʾeš.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "mʿayyānā hu ṭabbā. dukktā da-msīmā hu paṭrūpā da-ṣaḥḥā da-baytā. kol ḥad kāhel da-nnaṭṭar ṣalmē, āp ḥzātā da-ʾasīrē, aw lā. ḥad bēt gazzā šātpīn. ʾen hāy malyā, egartā ḥdattā kābar lā metnaṭṭrā.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "gbā qenyānā da-hāy mašmeštā kāhlā da-tšawwēh ptīḥ, āp ba-qelāyā da-mšawwyā men qdim, ʾak Syncthing. ršūtā qāymā, wa-qenyānā metqrē wa-metkteb men napšeh. egartā ḥdattā metnaṭṭrā. āp šqālā ʿābar. ṭukkās dukkātā qāʾem b-hānā maʾnā. yāwmānā ḥtīmā lā metkteb tammān. šrē ḥātmā b-trayhōn, hāydeyn ḥtom tūb.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "mellē, leššānā, wa-mabbuʿā ʾen ʾīt lāk.",
