    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "ṣalmē sakkīrīn ba-ddukkā da-msīmā. ptaḥ ennōn ba-ṭukkāsē da-tšawwē ḥad hārkā.",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "ṣalmē sakkīrīn ba-mʿayyānā. ptaḥ ennōn ba-ṭukkāsē da-tšawwē ḥad hārkā.",
