    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "A clip. Words are unforced. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.",
    "A few words, if you want": "A few words, if you will",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "A great bild or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the path, and the pack when the stead lets it.",
