    "This language leads the quotations. The buttons stay as they are.": "This tongue leads the saws. The knobs stay as they are.",
    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "The hoarded writs did not load. Free some room and open TLNotes again, or win back a backup. Eking a writ now starts a new daybook.",
