    "Add {n} event from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Eke {n} happening from this farspeaker? A matching happening is freshened, not duplicated.",
    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Eke {n} happenings from this farspeaker? A matching happening is freshened, not duplicated.",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Bilds, along with link forelooks, share this stead's scant room with your writs. If that room fills, a new writ may not be kept.",
