    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "A MyST pagine. Titles ben its names, and bondes ben its relations.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "A bok. The title is its name. Auctours and subgietes ben names of othere pagines.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "A bok. The title is its name. Auctours, forme, and edicion ben the record.",
    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "A clip. Wordis ben not nedeful. The lengthe kept is the bigynne, up to twenty secoundes.",
    "A few words, if you want": "A fewe wordis, if thou wantest",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "A greet pictur or clip is shrunk bifore it is kept. A clip longer than twenty secoundes kepeth oonly the bigynne. Fetching kepeth the adresse, and the fil whanne the site suffreth it.",
    "A long phrase is the sort of secret that holds.": "A long frase is the sorte of privé that holdeth.",
