    "A picture. Words are optional.": "A pictur. Wordis ben not nedeful.",
    "A property, a value, and only the qualifier and source that change the claim.": "A propriete, a valu, and oonly the qualifier and welle that chaunge the claim.",
    "A sealed journal is not written to the sync file. Unseal it on both devices to sync, then seal it again.": "A seeled daybok is not writen to the comun fil. Unseele it on bothe instrumentis to acord, thanne seele it agen.",
