    "A subject": "A subgiet",
    "A tap adds or removes a tag. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one. Order is the arrangement you dragged. Edited and Added sort by those times. Done stays hidden until you show it.": "A touche addeth or removeth a tagge. A double-touche or a long presse kepeth oonly that oon. Ordre is the arrangement thou didst drawe. Amended and Added sorte bi tho tymes. Doon stayeth hid til thou shewest it.",
