    "This language leads the quotations. The buttons stay as they are.": "This langage ledeth the seiynges. The knobbes stay as thei ben.",
    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "The stored billis dide not charge. Fre sum space and open TLNotes agen, or restore a kepynge. Adding a bille now bigynneth a newe daybok.",
