    "The phone calendar could not be read. Allow calendar access and try again.": "The telephon calender myghte not be rede. Suffre calender access and assaye agen.",
    "The phone calendar had nothing in the past year or the next two years.": "The telephon calender had no thing in the passed yeer or the nexte two yeers.",
