    "Add {n} event from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Adde {n} happeninge fro this telephon? A matching happeninge is renewed, not duplicated.",
    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Adde {n} happeninges fro this telephon? A matching happeninge is renewed, not duplicated.",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Picturis, and also bond foreshewynges, share this site's limited space with thi billis. If that space filleth, a newe bille may not be saved.",
