    "Installed site": "The site set inne",
    "Checking the published package.": "Checking the publisshed paket.",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "A newer Android paket is on the webside. Download it, thanne sette it inne. Sende forth fro Data firste if thou wantest a copie.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "This paket matcheth the oon on the webside.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "The webside paket myghte not be rede. No thing was downloaded.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Whanne this is on, an assaye may se the Android paket publisshed with the webside. No thing downloads til thou askest.",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "A lyf, with the comun billis outnumbering the seiynges. It may be removed.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Billis is everich thing kept. Media counteth picturis and clips saved in the daybok, not an adresse that stille pointeth elsewhere. Greetnesse is the hool kepynge. In media is how muche of that kepynge tho files take. Allowance is what this lookere wole yyve the site. Used is everich thing the site hath stored. The remenaunt is the rest.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "The lookere is a tabbe. The sette inne site is the hom skreen copie. Ech may kepe picturis, and also bond foreshewynges, or not. Thei share oon store. If that space filleth, a newe bille may not be saved.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Chese a fil this app may kepe open, and also oon in a foldere that alredy accordeth, swich as Syncthing. The leve stayeth, so the fil is rede and writen on its owene. The newer bille is kept. A deletion travelleth too. The ordre stayeth on this instrument. A seeled daybok is not writen there. Unseele on bothe instrumentis, thanne seele agen aftir.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "The wordis, the langage, and a welle if thou hast oon.",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "News of a chaunge in TLNotes. Added for thee. Not a type thou canst chese.",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Picturis ben off in the sette inne site. Turne hem on in Ordinaunces to kepe oon here.",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Picturis ben off in the lookere. Turne hem on in Ordinaunces to kepe oon here.",
