    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "The website package could not be read. Nought was downloaded.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "When this is on, a look upon can see the Android package published with the website. Nought downloads till thou askest.",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the sayings. It can be taken away.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Notes is everything kept. Likenesses counteth pictures and clips saved in the daybook, not an address that still pointeth elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In likenesses is how much of that backup those files take. Portion is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site hath stored. The rest is the rest.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "The browser is a tab. The set up site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link shewings, or not. They share one store. If that space filleth, a new note may not be saved.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Choose a file this work can keep open, including one in a folder that already joins, such as Syncthing. The permission stayeth, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travelleth too. The order stayeth on this device. A sealed daybook is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "The words, the tongue, and a source if thou hast one.",
