    "Ages": "Ylda",
    "A birthday lays one period for each year of life, from birth through the year now under way. That year stays open. Running it again replaces those periods.": "Ġebyrdtīd lecgeð ān fæc for ǣlcre yldo þæs līfes, fram ġebyrde oþ þæt gēar þe nū gǣð. Þæt gēar stent open. Eft ġedōn, þā fæc bið on ōðerra stede ġeseted.",
