    "Add to calendar": "Ēaca tō þām gērīme",
    "Move to trash": "Wecg tō þām āworpenum",
    "Add statement": "Ēaca ċīdung",
    "Choose the file both devices share.": "Ċēos þone fēl þe bēġen searu dǣlað.",
    "Opening…": "Openiende…",
    "Reading…": "Rǣdende…",
    "Reading the open view": "Rǣdende þā openan sċēawunge",
    "Fetching the model…": "Feccende þā bysne…",
    "The model did not load.": "Sēo bysen ne ġelād.",
    "Meaning is included": "Andġit is mid",
    "Sayings": "Cwidas",
    "Nothing in this view matches.": "Nān þing on þisse sċēawunge ġefērað.",
    "Nothing on the timeline to jump to yet.": "Nū gīet nān þing on þām tīdfære tō hlēapenne.",
    "The type filter is leaving them out of this list.": "Þæt cynnes āscead lǣteð hīe of þissum ġetæle.",
    "Drag a task by the bar at its edge. Drop it on another to nest it.": "Drag þæt weorc be þǣre speċe æt his ecge. Lǣt hit on ōðer, þæt hit innan sitte.",
    "Leave the end year empty and the line stays open.": "Lǣt þæt endeġēar īdel, and sēo līn stent open.",
    "The words in their original language are the title of the saying.": "Þā word on heora fruman sprǣce sind þæs cwides hēafod.",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Nīwung is ġearu and bīdeð oþ þæt þū hīe fremme. Ūtbringan of Ġewite ǣrest, ġif þū ġelīcnesse wille.",
    "This is an installed PWA.": "Þis is ġeseted PWA.",
    "1 done": "ān ġedōn",
    "1 note": "ān ġewrit",
    "1 open": "ān open",
    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "MyST tramet. Hēafdu sind his naman, and bendas his sibba.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "Bōc. Þæt hēafod is his nama. Wrīteras and þing sind naman ōðerra trameta.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "Bōc. Þæt hēafod is his nama. Wrīteras, ġesceap, and ūtġang sind se ġewit.",
