    "Write below to add a task, or edit any note and set its type to Task.": "Wrīt under tō ēacenne weorc, oþþe ādiht ǣniġ ġewrit and sette his cynn tō Weorce.",
    "Write this down. It is not shown again, and the previous recovery key no longer works.": "Wrīt þis nīðer. Hit ne bið eft ġeīewed, and sēo ǣrra edcǣġ ne wyrcð leng.",
