    "{name} is not a TLNotes sync file, so it was left alone.": "{name} nis TLNotes samodfēl, for þām hit wæs forlǣten.",
    "{name} is read and written with your notes.": "{name} bið ġerǣden and ġewriten mid þīnum ġewritum.",
    "{name} needs permission again. Choose it once more.": "{name} þearf eft lēafe. Ċēos hit eft āne.",
