    "quotations": "cwidas",
    "Original": "Fruma",
    "Original ({language})": "Fruma ({language})",
    "This language leads the quotations. The buttons stay as they are.": "Þēos sprǣc gǣð beforan þām cwidum. Þā cnæppas wuniað swā hīe sind.",
    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "Þā ġehealdenan ġewritu ne ġelādon. Frēo sumne rūm and open TLNotes eft, oþþe edstaðola cūþþbōc. Ġewrit nū ēacod onginneð nīwe dæġbōc.",
    "Moved {n} to trash": "{n} ġeweged tō þām āworpenum",
    "Tagged": "Ġetācnod",
    "The phone calendar could not be read. Allow calendar access and try again.": "Se feorrūnes gērīm ne mihte bēon ġerǣden. Þafa gērīmes innfær and eft cunnā.",
    "The phone calendar had nothing in the past year or the next two years.": "Se feorrūnes gērīm næfde nān þing on þām ġegānenum gēare ne on þām twām tōweardum.",
    "Import the phone calendar": "Inbringan þone feorrūnes gērīm",
    "Add {n} event from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Ēaca {n} ġelimp of þissum feorrūne? Ġefērend ġelimp bið ġenīwod, nā ġetwifealdod.",
    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Ēaca {n} ġelimp of þissum feorrūne? Ġefērend ġelimp bið ġenīwod, nā ġetwifealdod.",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Anlīcnessa, ēac benda foresċēawunga, dǣlað þisse stōwe ġemetne rūm mid þīnum ġewritum. Ġif se rūm full wierð, nīwe ġewrit ne mæg bēon ġehealden.",
    "Pictures kept in this copy will be removed.": "Anlīcnessa þe on þisse ġelīcnesse ġehealden sind bið ofnumen.",
    "{n} selected": "{n} ġecoren",
    "Tag": "Tācn",
    "The tag is added to every selected note. Tags they already have stay.": "Þæt tācn bið ġeēacod tō ǣlcum ġecorenum ġewrite. Tācnu þe hīe ǣr habbað wuniað.",
    "Add another source": "Ēaca ōðerne fruman",
    "About this type": "Be þissum cynne",
    "Times": "Tīda",
    "Update": "Nīwung",
    "Website package": "Wefstōwe bǣr",
    "This package only": "Þēos bǣr ānlīce",
    "Check the website": "Sċēawa þā wefstōwe",
    "Download the Android update": "Niðerhād þā Android nīwunge",
    "Browser": "Sceawere",
    "Installed site": "Ġeseted stōw",
    "Checking the published package.": "Sċēawiende þā ġebodenan bǣre.",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Nīwre Android bǣr is on þǣre wefstōwe. Niðerhād hīe, þonne ġesete. Ūtbringan of Ġewite ǣrest, ġif þū ġelīcnesse wille.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "Þēos bǣr ġefērað þǣre on þǣre wefstōwe.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "Sēo wefstōwe bǣr ne mihte bēon ġerǣden. Nān þing wæs niðerġehāded.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Þonne þis on is, sċēawung mæg þā Android bǣre ġesēon þe mid þǣre wefstōwe ġeboden is. Nān þing niðerhādeð ǣr þū bidde.",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "Līf, þǣr ġewunelicu ġewritu mā sind þonne cwidas. Hit mæg bēon ofnumen.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Ġewritu sind eall þæt ġehealden is. Anlīcnessa rīmað anlīcnessa and snǣdas þe on þǣre dæġbōce ġehealden sind, nā stīġe þe gīet elles hwider wīsað. Miċelu is sēo fulle cūþþbōc. On anlīcnessum is hū miċel þǣre cūþþbōce þā fēlas nimað. Lēaf is þæt þes sceawere þǣre stōwe syleð. Ġebrocen is eall þæt sēo stōw ġehealden hæfð. Lāf is þæt lāf.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Se sceawere is bred. Sēo ġesetede stōw is hāmbrede ġelīcnes. Ǣġðer mæg anlīcnessa healdan, ēac benda foresċēawunga, oþþe nā. Hīe dǣlað ānne hord. Ġif se rūm full wierð, nīwe ġewrit ne mæg bēon ġehealden.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Ċēos fēl þe þis tōl open healdan mæg, ēac ānne innan fæce þe ǣr samod gǣð, swā swā Syncthing. Sēo lēaf wunað, þæt se fēl self bið ġerǣden and ġewriten. Þæt nīwre ġewrit bið ġehealden. Ādīlegednes færeð ēac. Se endebyrd wunað on þissum searwe. Insegled dæġbōc þǣr ne bið ġewriten. Onlūc on bām searwum, þonne eft insegla.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "Þā word, sēo sprǣc, and fruma ġif þū ānne hæbbe.",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "Spell wendunge on TLNotes. Þē ġeēacod. Nis cynn þe þū ċēosan mæġe.",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Anlīcnessa sind of on þǣre ġesetedan stōwe. Wend hīe on on Dihte, þæt þū hēr āne healde.",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Anlīcnessa sind of on þām sceawere. Wend hīe on on Dihte, þæt þū hēr āne healde.",
