    "Drag a task by the bar at its edge. Drop it on another to nest it.": "Tarraing tasc leis an mbarra ar a imeall. Scaoil ar cheann eile é chun é a neadú.",
    "Leave the end year empty and the line stays open.": "Fág bliain an deiridh folamh agus fanann an líne ar oscailt.",
    "The words in their original language are the title of the saying.": "Is iad na focail ina dteanga bhunaidh teideal an athfhocail.",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Tá nuashonrú réidh agus fanann sé go gcuireann tú i bhfeidhm é. Easpórtáil ó Shonraí ar dtús más mian leat cóip.",
    "This is an installed PWA.": "Is PWA suiteáilte é seo.",
    "1 done": "1 déanta",
    "1 note": "1 nóta",
    "1 open": "1 ar oscailt",
    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "Leathanach MyST. Is iad na teidil a ainmneacha, agus is iad na naisc a ghaolta.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "Leabhar. Is é an teideal a ainm. Is ainmneacha leathanach eile iad údair agus ábhair.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "Leabhar. Is é an teideal a ainm. Is iad an t-údar, an fhoirm agus an t-eagrán an taifead.",
    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "Gearrthóg. Tá focail roghnach. Is é an tosach an fad a choinnítear, suas le fiche soicind.",
    "A few words, if you want": "Cúpla focal, más mian leat",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "Laghdaítear pictiúr mór nó gearrthóg sula gcoinnítear é. Ní choinníonn gearrthóg níos faide ná fiche soicind ach an tosach. Coinníonn fáil an seoladh, agus an comhad nuair a cheadaíonn an suíomh é.",
    "A long phrase is the sort of secret that holds.": "Is é frása fada an saghas rúin a sheasann.",
    "A name": "Ainm",
    "A name, or Q42": "Ainm, nó Q42",
    "A new tag": "Clib nua",
    "A person in the repertorium. Not a timeline note.": "Duine sa repertóir. Ní nóta amlíne é.",
    "A person, kept in the repertorium. The title is the name.": "Duine, coinnithe sa repertóir. Is é an teideal an t-ainm.",
    "A picture. Words are optional.": "Pictiúr. Tá focail roghnach.",
    "A property, a value, and only the qualifier and source that change the claim.": "Airí, luach, agus an cháilitheoir agus an fhoinse amháin a athraíonn an t-éileamh.",
    "A sealed journal is not written to the sync file. Unseal it on both devices to sync, then seal it again.": "Ní scríobhtar dialann shéalaithe sa chomhad sioncronaithe. Bain an séala ar an dá ghléas chun sioncronú, ansin séalaigh arís.",
    "A small picture address": "Seoladh pictiúir bhig",
    "A span. It draws a line across the timeline.": "Ré. Tarraingíonn sí líne trasna na hamline.",
    "A subject": "Ábhar",
    "A tap adds or removes a tag. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one. Order is the arrangement you dragged. Edited and Added sort by those times. Done stays hidden until you show it.": "Cuireann tap clib leis nó baineann sé í. Ní choinníonn tap dúbailte nó brú fada ach an ceann sin. Is é an tOrd an leagan a tharraing tú. Sórtálann Curtha in eagar agus Curtha leis de réir na n-amanna sin. Fanann Déanta folaithe go dtí go dtaispeánann tú é.",
    "A tap adds or removes. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one.": "Cuireann tap leis nó baineann sé. Ní choinníonn tap dúbailte nó brú fada ach an ceann sin.",
