    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Cuir {n} imeacht leis ón bhfón seo? Nuashonraítear imeacht a thagann leis, ní dhéantar dúblach de.",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Roinneann pictiúir, réamhamhairc nasc san áireamh, spás teoranta an tsuímh seo le do nótaí. Má líonann an spás sin, seans nach sábhálfar nóta nua.",
