    "Download the Android update": "Íoslódáil nuashonrú Android",
    "Browser": "Brabhsálaí",
    "Installed site": "Suíomh suiteáilte",
    "Checking the published package.": "Ag seiceáil an phacáiste fhoilsithe.",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Tá pacáiste Android níos nuaí ar an suíomh. Íoslódáil é, ansin suiteáil é. Easpórtáil ó Shonraí ar dtús más mian leat cóip.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "Tagann an pacáiste seo leis an gceann ar an suíomh.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "Níorbh fhéidir pacáiste an tsuímh a léamh. Níor íoslódáladh aon rud.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Nuair a bhíonn sé seo ann, is féidir le seiceáil pacáiste Android atá foilsithe leis an suíomh a fheiceáil. Ní íoslódáiltear aon rud go n-iarrann tú é.",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "Saol, agus na gnáthnótaí níos líonmhaire ná na hathfhocail. Is féidir é a bhaint.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Is é Nótaí gach rud a choinnítear. Áiríonn Meáin pictiúir agus gearrthóga atá sábháilte sa dialann, ní seoladh a thugann fós áit eile. Is é Méid an cúltaca ar fad. Is é Sna meáin an méid den chúltaca sin a thógann na comhaid sin. Is é Liúntas an méid a thabharfaidh an brabhsálaí seo don suíomh. Is é Úsáidte gach rud atá stóráilte ag an suíomh. Is é Fuílleach an chuid eile.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Is cluaisín é an brabhsálaí. Is é an suíomh suiteáilte cóip an scáileáin baile. Féadann gach ceann pictiúir a choinneáil, réamhamhairc nasc san áireamh, nó gan iad. Roinneann siad aon stór amháin. Má líonann an spás sin, seans nach sábhálfar nóta nua.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Roghnaigh comhad is féidir leis an aip seo a choinneáil ar oscailt, fiú ceann i bhfillteán a shioncronaíonn cheana, amhail Syncthing. Fanann an cead, mar sin léitear agus scríobhtar an comhad as féin. Coinnítear an nóta is nuaí. Téann scriosadh leis freisin. Fanann an leagan amach ar an ngléas seo. Ní scríobhtar dialann shéalaithe ann. Bain an séala ar an dá ghléas, ansin séalaigh arís.",
    "The words, the language, and a source if you have one.": "Na focail, an teanga, agus foinse más ann duit í.",
    "News of a change in TLNotes. Added for you. Not a type you can choose.": "Scéal faoi athrú i TLNotes. Curtha leis duit. Ní cineál is féidir leat a roghnú.",
    "Pictures are off in the installed site. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Tá pictiúir as ar an suíomh suiteáilte. Cas orthu iad sna Socruithe chun ceann a choinneáil anseo.",
    "Pictures are off in the browser. Turn them on in Settings to keep one here.": "Tá pictiúir as sa bhrabhsálaí. Cas orthu iad sna Socruithe chun ceann a choinneáil anseo.",
