    "Choose the file both devices share.": "Tagh am faidhle a tha an dà inneal a' roinn.",
    "Opening…": "A' fosgladh…",
    "Reading…": "A' leughadh…",
    "Reading the open view": "A' leughadh an t-seallaidh fhosgailte",
    "Fetching the model…": "A' faighinn a' mhodail…",
    "The model did not load.": "Cha do luchdaich am modail.",
    "Meaning is included": "Tha a' chiall air a gabhail a-steach",
    "Sayings": "Luaidhean",
    "Nothing in this view matches.": "Chan eil dad san t-sealladh seo a' freagairt.",
    "Nothing on the timeline to jump to yet.": "Chan eil dad air an loidhne-ama airson leum thuige fhathast.",
    "The type filter is leaving them out of this list.": "Tha criathar an t-seòrsa gan fhàgail às an liosta seo.",
    "Drag a task by the bar at its edge. Drop it on another to nest it.": "Slaod gnìomh leis a' bhàr air oir. Leig às e air fear eile gus a neadachadh.",
    "Leave the end year empty and the line stays open.": "Fàg bliadhna a' chinn falamh agus fanaidh an loidhne fosgailte.",
    "The words in their original language are the title of the saying.": "Is iad na faclan nan cànan tùsail tiotal na luaidh.",
    "An update is ready and waits until you apply it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Tha ùrachadh deiseil agus feitheamh gus an cuir thu an sàs e. Às-phortaich o Dhàta an toiseach ma tha lethbhreac agad a dhìth.",
    "This is an installed PWA.": "Is PWA stàlaichte a tha seo.",
    "1 done": "1 dèanta",
    "1 note": "1 nòta",
    "1 open": "1 fosgailte",
    "A MyST page. Titles are its names, and links are its relations.": "Duilleag MyST. Is iad na tiotalan a h-ainmean, agus is iad na ceanglaichean a dàimhean.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors and subjects are names of other pages.": "Leabhar. Is e an tiotal ainm. Is ainmean dhuilleagan eile a th' ann an ùghdaran agus cuspairean.",
    "A book. The title is its name. Authors, form, and edition are the record.": "Leabhar. Is e an tiotal ainm. Is iad ùghdaran, cruth, agus deasachadh an clàr.",
    "A clip. Words are optional. The length kept is the start, up to twenty seconds.": "Gearradh. Tha faclan roghainneil. Is e an toiseach an fhaid a tha air a ghleidheadh, suas ri fichead diog.",
    "A few words, if you want": "Beagan fhaclan, ma thogras tu",
    "A large picture or clip is shrunk before it is kept. A clip longer than twenty seconds keeps only the start. Fetching keeps the address, and the file when the site allows it.": "Thèid dealbh mòr no gearradh a lùghdachadh mus tèid a ghleidheadh. Cha ghlèidh gearradh nas fhaide na fichead diog ach an toiseach. Glèidhidh faighinn an seòladh, agus am faidhle nuair a leigeas an làrach leis.",
    "A long phrase is the sort of secret that holds.": "Is e abairt fhada an seòrsa rùin a sheasas.",
    "A name": "Ainm",
    "A name, or Q42": "Ainm, no Q42",
    "A new tag": "Taga ùr",
    "A person in the repertorium. Not a timeline note.": "Duine san leabhar-chlàr. Chan e nòta loidhne-ama a tha seo.",
    "A person, kept in the repertorium. The title is the name.": "Duine, air a ghleidheadh san leabhar-chlàr. Is e an tiotal an t-ainm.",
    "A picture. Words are optional.": "Dealbh. Tha faclan roghainneil.",
    "A property, a value, and only the qualifier and source that change the claim.": "Feart, luach, agus a-mhàin an càileachdair agus an tùs a dh'atharraicheas an tagradh.",
    "A sealed journal is not written to the sync file. Unseal it on both devices to sync, then seal it again.": "Cha tèid leabhar-latha seulaichte a sgrìobhadh don fhaidhle sioncronachaidh. Thoir an seula dheth air an dà inneal gus sioncronachadh, an uair sin seulaich a-rithist.",
    "A small picture address": "Seòladh deilbh bhig",
    "A span. It draws a line across the timeline.": "Ùine. Tarraingidh i loidhne tarsainn na loidhne-ama.",
    "A subject": "Cuspair",
    "A tap adds or removes a tag. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one. Order is the arrangement you dragged. Edited and Added sort by those times. Done stays hidden until you show it.": "Cuiridh gnogadh taga ris no bheir e air falbh e. Cha ghlèidh gnogadh dùbailte no brùthadh fada ach an tè sin. Is e an t-Òrdugh an co-dhealbhadh a shlaod thu. Seòrsaichidh Deasaichte agus Air a chur ris a rèir nan amannan sin. Fanaidh Dèanta falaichte gus an seall thu e.",
    "A tap adds or removes. A double-tap or a long press keeps only that one.": "Cuiridh gnogadh ris no bheir e air falbh. Cha ghlèidh gnogadh dùbailte no brùthadh fada ach an tè sin.",
    "A title and an address.": "Tiotal agus seòladh.",
    "A translator": "Eadar-theangair",
    "A wiki address": "Seòladh wiki",
    "A window was blocked. Allow it, or open TLNotes in its own tab and choose the file there.": "Chaidh uinneag a bhacadh. Leig leatha, no fosgail TLNotes na thaba fhèin agus tagh am faidhle an sin.",
    "A word": "Facal",
    "A word, in the language it was kept.": "Facal, anns a' chànan anns an deach a ghleidheadh.",
    "A work, with its author and its date.": "Obair, le a h-ùghdar agus a ceann-latha.",
    "A year, and a month if you want one.": "Bliadhna, agus mìos ma thogras tu fear.",
    "About arranging tasks": "Mu dheidhinn gnìomhan a rèiteachadh",
    "Add a source": "Cuir tùs ris",
    "Add another appearance": "Cuir coltas eile ris",
    "Add one, or choose from the tags already in the journal.": "Cuir fear ris, no tagh bho na tagaichean a tha san leabhar-latha mar-thà.",
    "Add tags": "Cuir tagaichean ris",
    "Add {n} item from the calendar? Matching notes are updated, not duplicated.": "Cuir {n} nì ris on mhìosachan? Thèid nòtaichean a tha a' freagairt ùrachadh, chan e an dùblachadh.",
    "Add {n} items from the calendar? Matching notes are updated, not duplicated.": "Cuir {n} nithean ris on mhìosachan? Thèid nòtaichean a tha a' freagairt ùrachadh, chan e an dùblachadh.",
    "Added": "Air a chur ris",
    "Added. Clear search to see it.": "Air a chur ris. Glan an lorg gus fhaicinn.",
    "Address it was fetched from": "An seòladh às an deach a thoirt",
    "Addresses, with the preview that came back with them.": "Seòlaidhean, leis an ro-shealladh a thàinig air ais leotha.",
    "All notes cleared": "A h-uile nòta air a ghlanadh",
    "An author": "Ùghdar",
    "Another title": "Tiotal eile",
    "Attach": "Ceangail",
    "Attach a picture or clip": "Ceangail dealbh no gearradh",
    "Author": "Ùghdar",
    "Authors": "Ùghdaran",
    "Available tags": "Tagaichean ri fhaighinn",
    "Back": "Air ais",
    "Begins": "A' tòiseachadh",
    "Calendar exported": "Mìosachan air às-phortadh",
    "Calendar imported": "Mìosachan air ion-phortadh",
    "Caption": "Fo-thiotal",
    "Change": "Atharraich",
    "Choose a picture or a video.": "Tagh dealbh no bhideo.",
    "Choose the file in the window that just opened. This page can use it once that is done.": "Tagh am faidhle san uinneig a dh'fhosgail dìreach. Faodaidh an duilleag seo a chleachdadh nuair a bhios sin dèante.",
    "Chromium hides the file picker in a page that is inside another window, or that is not https. Open TLNotes in its own tab and choose the file there.": "Falaichidh Chromium taghadair nam faidhle air duilleag a tha am broinn uinneige eile, no nach eil https. Fosgail TLNotes na thaba fhèin agus tagh am faidhle an sin.",
    "Clear all data": "Glan an dàta gu lèir",
    "Clear search": "Glan an lorg",
    "Clip": "Gearradh",
    "Clip length": "Faid a' ghearradh",
    "Close": "Dùin",
    "Color {color}": "Dath {color}",
    "Copied": "Air lethbhreac a dhèanamh",
    "Could not attach that.": "Cha b' urrainn sin a cheangal.",
    "Could not copy": "Cha b' urrainn lethbhreac a dhèanamh",
    "Could not copy that file.": "Cha b' urrainn lethbhreac dhen fhaidhle sin a dhèanamh.",
    "Could not copy that link": "Cha b' urrainn lethbhreac dhen cheangal sin a dhèanamh",
    "Could not copy that link.": "Cha b' urrainn lethbhreac dhen cheangal sin a dhèanamh.",
    "Could not fetch that.": "Cha b' urrainn sin fhaighinn.",
    "Could not keep that audio.": "Cha b' urrainn an fhuaim sin a ghleidheadh.",
    "Could not keep that clip.": "Cha b' urrainn an gearradh sin a ghleidheadh.",
