    "The stored notes did not load. Free some space and open TLNotes again, or restore a backup. Adding a note now starts a new journal.": "Cha do luchdaich na nòtaichean stòraichte. Saor beagan rùim agus fosgail TLNotes a-rithist, no ath-stèidhich cùl-taic. Tòisichidh nòta a-nis leabhar-latha ùr.",
