    "Import the phone calendar": "Ion-phortaich mìosachan an fhòn",
    "Add {n} event from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Cuir {n} tachartas ris on fhòn seo? Thèid tachartas a tha a' freagairt ùrachadh, chan e a dhùblachadh.",
    "Add {n} events from this phone? A matching event is updated, not duplicated.": "Cuir {n} tachartasan ris on fhòn seo? Thèid tachartas a tha a' freagairt ùrachadh, chan e a dhùblachadh.",
    "Pictures, including link previews, share this site's limited space with your notes. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Tha dealbhan, a' gabhail a-steach ro-sheallaidhean ceangail, a' roinn rùm chuingealaichte na làraich seo le do nòtaichean. Ma lìonas an rùm sin, 's dòcha nach tèid nòta ùr a shàbhaladh.",
