    "Checking the published package.": "A' sgrùdadh a' phasgain fhoillsichte.",
    "A newer Android package is on the website. Download it, then install it. Export from Data first if you want a copy.": "Tha pasgan Android nas ùire air an làrach. Luchdaich a-nuas e, an uair sin stàlaich e. Às-phortaich o Dhàta an toiseach ma tha lethbhreac agad a dhìth.",
    "This package matches the one on the website.": "Tha am pasgan seo a' freagairt ris an fhear air an làrach.",
    "The website package could not be read. Nothing was downloaded.": "Cha b' urrainn pasgan na làraich a leughadh. Cha deach dad a luchdachadh a-nuas.",
    "When this is on, a check can see the Android package published with the website. Nothing downloads until you ask.": "Nuair a tha seo air, faodaidh sgrùdadh pasgan Android a tha foillsichte leis an làrach fhaicinn. Cha luchdaich dad a-nuas gus an iarr thu e.",
    "A life, with the ordinary notes outnumbering the quotations. It can be removed.": "Beatha, leis na nòtaichean àbhaisteach nas lìonmhoire na na luaidhean. Faodar a thoirt air falbh.",
    "Notes is everything kept. Media counts pictures and clips saved in the journal, not an address that still points elsewhere. Size is the whole backup. In media is how much of that backup those files take. Allowance is what this browser will give the site. Used is everything the site has stored. Remaining is the rest.": "Is e Nòtaichean a h-uile rud a tha air a ghleidheadh. Tha Meadhanan a' cunntadh dhealbhan agus ghearraidhean a chaidh a shàbhaladh san leabhar-latha, chan e seòladh a tha fhathast a' comharrachadh àite eile. Is e Meud an làn-chùl-taic. Is e Anns na meadhanan na tha de'n chùl-taic sin a' gabhail nam faidhlichean sin. Is e Cuibhreann na bheir am brabhsair seo don làrach. Is e Air a chleachdadh a h-uile rud a tha an làrach air a stòradh. Is e An còrr an còrr.",
    "The browser is a tab. The installed site is the home screen copy. Each can keep pictures, including link previews, or not. They share one store. If that space fills, a new note may not be saved.": "Is taba a th' anns a' bhrabhsair. Is e an làrach stàlaichte lethbhreac na sgrìn dachaigh. Faodaidh gach fear dealbhan a ghleidheadh, a' gabhail a-steach ro-sheallaidhean ceangail, no nach eil. Tha iad a' roinn aon stòr. Ma lìonas an rùm sin, 's dòcha nach tèid nòta ùr a shàbhaladh.",
    "Choose a file this app can keep open, including one in a folder that already syncs, such as Syncthing. The permission stays, so the file is read and written on its own. The newer note is kept. A deletion travels too. The layout stays on this device. A sealed journal is not written there. Unseal on both devices, then seal again after.": "Tagh faidhle as urrainn don aplacaid seo a chumail fosgailte, fiù tè am broinn pasgain a tha a' sioncronachadh mar-thà, leithid Syncthing. Fanaidh a' chead, mar sin tha am faidhle air a leughadh agus air a sgrìobhadh leis fhèin. Tha an nòta as ùire air a ghleidheadh. Thèid dubhadh às leis cuideachd. Fanaidh an co-dhealbhadh air an inneal seo. Cha tèid leabhar-latha seulaichte a sgrìobhadh an sin. Thoir an seula dheth air an dà inneal, an uair sin seulaich a-rithist.",
